{"authorDailyContributionsMap":{"Yx0905":[{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"1d2a596181a6e771bc6bc3c2290112827746604b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add Yuxiang to AboutUs page","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":6,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-04T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"8a7630a3f32147abc46cf4560fb284b5b28a7ddf","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"README.md: Replace AB3 sample text with Astra intro","messageBody":"The README still describes AB3 as a sample project for students,\nwhich does not match our product.\n\nLet\u0027s add the product title, a one-line description and the target\nusers, and remove the AB3 sample bullets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xt8WZiTKRufrmH5H1szLZL\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":5,"deletions":10}}},{"hash":"dc93c7757c5de2b467cfd494db8f2be4395b5fb2","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into update-readme-astra-intro","messageBody":"Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xt8WZiTKRufrmH5H1szLZL\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"26717fc84dab8f09426493501609fec3de5d9b08","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"DG: Add user stories on editing and customising","messageBody":"The DG lists only AB3\u0027s user stories, so it does not cover the\nediting and customisation needs of Astra\u0027s users.\n\nLet\u0027s add the user stories for editing contact details, undoing\nmistakes, spotting incomplete entries, reordering contact info,\ndefining command shortcuts and reusing field templates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xt8WZiTKRufrmH5H1szLZL\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":6,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"748ab21a3316913554656fd020c49c18903303e0","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"DG: Add use case for editing a contact","messageBody":"The DG has no use case for the edit command, which needs several\nsteps when the name matches many contacts or a new value clashes\nwith another contact.\n\nLet\u0027s add UC04 to describe the main success scenario and how Astra\nhandles each of those cases.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xt8WZiTKRufrmH5H1szLZL\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":59,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"57180212c660a61e2f9da0c2478ca71c2adaa791","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"DG: Add NFRs on error messages and packaging","messageBody":"The DG lists only AB3\u0027s NFRs. Astra also needs clear error messages,\nbecause fast typists should fix a mistyped command without opening\nthe user guide, and must run as a single JAR without an installer.\n\nLet\u0027s add these two NFRs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xt8WZiTKRufrmH5H1szLZL\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":2,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"901c784af25756d6ef2a92bc363206a533263d8a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"DG: Add glossary terms for stored values","messageBody":"The use cases and NFRs refer to how Astra cleans up, stores and\nidentifies values, but the glossary does not define these terms.\n\nLet\u0027s define normalisation, display value and unique key.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xt8WZiTKRufrmH5H1szLZL\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":3,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"77ba55e243f8efe2522b9f898e2bc4d7dd29977b","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into update-readme-astra-intro","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"536b2090235b899bec79fac425aa8779ce